@cc [owner:jchen0824,label:security;testing] immutable-image-receipts
The image verifier must require an explicit expected patch commit and reject receipts with a different patch SHA, unknown, missing, or duplicate enabled roles, source SHA mismatches, mutable image references, and receipts whose Dockerfile, target, or migration command differs from the manifest.

@cc [owner:jchen0824,label:security] local-validation-only
Mindora build tooling must not authenticate to a registry or publish an image until an approved immutable registry target is recorded outside this source tree.

@cc [owner:jchen0824,label:testing] patched-build-metadata
Every local build must record the exact patched checkout in runtime commit metadata and evidence while preserving the pinned upstream Dust commit as a separate source field; CI must build each unique Dockerfile/target pair at most once per run.
